--- exit 2
codemap: usage: codemap proposal list
       | new <name> [--body FILE|-]
       | archive <slug> [--pr N]
       | show <slug> [--status open|done|wontfix]
       | item <slug> <id> [--status open|done|wontfix] [--reply TEXT]
       | request <slug> --kind KIND --target ID [--file F --lines A-B] [--to X] --text TEXT
       [--root DIR] [--json]

